OL,3,AL'Oreal says weight loss drugs are
OL,4,Aimpacting beauty and skincare sales
OL,5,
OL,6,FBeauty giant L'Oreal says the rise of
OL,7,Fweight loss drugs has affected beauty
OL,8,Fand skincare sales, as it designs
OL,9,Fproducts to specifically target some
OL,10,Fside-effects of rapid weight loss.
OL,12,FThe company's head Nicolas Hieronimus
OL,13,Fsaid the beauty market was proving
OL,14,Fresilient in a challenging global
OL,15,Fcontext and that the use of GLP-1s was
OL,16,F"a very important phenomenon for us".
OL,18,FHe told an investor call that the rise
OL,19,Fin their use was "having an impact on
OL,20,Fbeauty consumption and skin care
OL,21,Fconsumption in particular".
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
