OL,3,AL'Oreal says weight loss drugs are
OL,4,Aimpacting beauty and skincare sales
OL,5,
OL,6,FL'Oreal, which owns other popular
OL,7,Fbrands including Maybelline and La
OL,8,FRoche-Posay, announced on Thursday that
OL,9,Fsales in the three months to September
OL,10,Frose by 7.7%, above analyst
OL,11,Fexpectations.
